        "### Data Cleaning & Preparation\n",
        "\n",
        "Before creating the dashboard, we'll perform some basic cleaning:\n",
        "*   Fill missing 'age' values with the median.\n",
        "*   Fill missing 'embarked' values with the mode.\n",
        "*   Drop the 'deck' column due to many missing values and potentially low predictive power for general insights.\n",
        "*   Create an 'AgeGroup' column for categorical analysis of age."
      ]
    },
